== (n>=2?2:n===1?1:0) with n = notchChange(p,c)","AC-12: notchCalculator(...).wl / countryRatingChangeWl(...) → (\"A\",\"A-\") 0/1, (\"BBB+\",\"BBB-\") 1/2, (\"BBB+\",\"BB+\") 2/2","AC-13 (indicator part): src/indicators/countryRating.mjs imports notchChange from '../ratings/notch.mjs' and nothing else; countryRatingChangeWl.length === 2; no node:fs/http/https/fetch/process use and no console.*; calls write nothing to stdout/stderr and leave the arguments unchanged","AC-14: `node --test` from the repo root exits 0, runs test/ratings/notch.test.mjs and test/indicators/countryRating.test.mjs (together covering AC-1..AC-13), and package.json still has no dependencies/devDependencies"]}
